OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man injured in
OL,4,Achemical incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof grievous bodily harm after a man was
OL,8,Finjured in "an incident involving a
OL,9,Fchemical substance" in Crawley, police
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,13,Faddress in Fletcher Close, Southgate,
OL,14,Fon Sunday, at about 05:10 BST.
OL,16,FA 40-year-old man has been taken to
OL,17,Fhospital to be treated for injuries,
OL,18,FSussex Police said.
OL,20,FThey added the woman who was arrested,
OL,21,F40, has also been taken to hospital as
OL,22,Fa precaution.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
